listening, accountability, and community engagement as trust-building practices."}]}, {"id": "16e1325d-0aaf-4276-bfc9-05fdf0b8bd10", "type": "topic", "title": "Algorithms, AI, Surveillance, and Datafied Society", "description": null, "children": [{"id": "96f79da6-d31a-40dd-8f9e-b2ef80d87e01", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Algorithmic visibility", "children": [{"id": "c6a44831-cb16-4102-aa38-cf842038dae3", "type": "concept", "title": "ranking"}, {"id": "2a43694c-7143-4abc-8475-31c66940fa55", "type": "concept", "title": "recommendation systems"}, {"id": "3d536fe1-832a-467e-a566-c3b20f2625eb", "type": "concept", "title": "personalization"}], "description": "Students examine how recommendation systems and search rankings organize what people see."}, {"id": "c1c09608-1cbb-4c74-815b-e87db3a68881", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Generative AI and synthetic media", "children": [{"id": "a88c7f57-0d7b-4f27-affe-45b6505e556e", "type": "concept", "title": "deepfakes"}, {"id": "a19962fa-177e-43b2-89bd-4cb6081bbc87", "type": "concept", "title": "AI disclosure"}, {"id": "e3402502-3742-4f5e-bbfc-56d8aa916a17", "type": "concept", "title": "creative labor"}], "description": "The class covers AI-generated text, images, audio, video, disclosure, authenticity, and labor implications."}, {"id": "0fd0436d-be1e-4963-8e8f-af8fdaeef843", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Surveillance and data extraction", "children": [{"id": "7c203e8a-a584-4e05-8661-520241b29e2e", "type": "concept", "title": "tracking"}, {"id": "bae299da-0f10-4431-b9f6-8f386a97b4a2", "type": "concept", "title": "data brokers"}, {"id": "22f4f0f4-dd44-464c-b21f-aa70a2fa65b6", "type": "concept", "title": "targeted advertising"}], "description": "Students analyze how platforms, advertisers, states, and employers collect and use behavioral data."}, {"id": "2bbb6774-fc33-4abf-8e00-d8021b23f7ec", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Algorithmic accountability", "children": [{"id": "38884da7-b79e-41bb-9222-73ece7b00022", "type": "concept", "tit